Terminals unused in grammar

    PREC_BOT
    PREC_TOP
    UNARY_MINUS


Grammar

    0 $accept: start_symbol "end of input"

    1 start_symbol: lilypond

    2 $@1: ε

    3 start_symbol: "#{" $@1 embedded_lilypond

    4 lilypond: ε
    5         | lilypond toplevel_expression
    6         | lilypond assignment
    7         | lilypond error
    8         | lilypond "\\version-error"

